--- !u!114 &1919500108
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1919500106}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "  <size=125%><b>Game Guide</b></size>\r\n\r\n  <size=100%><b>Game Description</b></size>\r\n 
    You will play as a brave princess on a journey to save the\r\n  kingdom. Legend
    has it that mysterious gems scattered\r\n  across different regions hold powerful
    energy. Only by\r\n  collecting them and surviving each trial can the darkness\r\n 
    threatening the kingdom be lifted.\r\n\r\n  Along the way, you will encounter
    different enemy types\r\n  with their own behaviours and combat styles.\r\n 
    Collect coins across the map to unlock stronger attack\r\n  abilities, gather
    the required gems, and complete each\r\n  level\u2019s challenge to finally save
    the kingdom.\r\n\r\n  <size=100%><b>Controls</b></size>\r\n  <b>W</b> Move Forward
    / <b>S</b> Move Backward\r\n  <b>A D</b> Turn Left / Right\r\n  <b>Shift</b>
    Run\r\n  <b>Space</b> Jump\r\n  <b>Hold Right Mouse Button</b> Rotate camera\r\n 
    <b>Left Mouse Button</b> Attack\r\n  <b>1 2 3</b> Switch attack modes\r\n\r\n 
    <size=100%><b>Combat</b></size>\r\n  <b>Attack 1</b>: Basic attack (low damage)\r\n 
    <b>Attack 2</b>: Unlockable (medium damage)\r\n  <b>Attack 3</b>: Unlockable
    (high damage)\r\n\r\n  <b>Dog</b>: Fast melee chaser\r\n  <b>Lich</b>: Patrols
    and guards important items\r\n  <b>Wizard</b>: Stronger enemy that enters a second
    phase\n  when health is low\r\n\r\n  Use movement and positioning to avoid continuous\r\n 
    damage.\r\n\r\n  <size=100%><b>Collection & Progression</b></size>\r\n  Collect
    coins placed in the level to unlock stronger attack\n  abilities.\r\n  Green
    items restore health.\n  Each level requires collecting a specific number of
    gems.\n  Reach the exit after completing the objective.\r\n\r\n  <size=100%><b>Level
    Objectives</b></size>\r\n  <b>Level 1</b>: Collect 2 gems within 40 seconds\r\n 
    <b>Level 2</b>: Collect 2 gems within 60 seconds\r\n  <b>Level 3</b>: Collect
    3 gems within 90 seconds\r\n\r\n  Later levels contain stronger enemies and higher\n 
    pressure.\r\n\r\n  <size=100%><b>Victory & Defeat</b></size>\r\n  Health reaches
    0 -> Defeat\r\n  Time reaches 0 -> Defeat\r\n  Collect all required gems and
    reach the goal -> Victory\r\n  Completing Level 3 -> The kingdom is saved\r\n\r\n 
    <size=100%><b>Tips</b></size>\r\n  Use running and movement to avoid enemy attacks.\r\n 
    Prioritize collecting coins to unlock stronger attacks.\r\n  Watch the countdown
    timer in each level.\r\n  Be careful when the wizard enters its second combat\n 
    phase.\r\n  Use the mini-map to track direction and objectives\n  (mouse wheel
    to zoom in/out).\r\n  Adjust music and sound via the button in the bottom-left\n 
    corner.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
